Run plots and other external task sources
----------------------------------------

The paper examples' *-progress.png files and supplementary Pet
score-versus-iteration plots, including notebook outputs, are locally generated
SIDERIUS run visualizations. Their underlying task/data attribution still
applies. They are simplified demo results, not copied paper figures or a claim
of one-command reproduction of paper artifacts.

SuperNEMO, Majorana and Cancer task provenance records identify their external
sources and applicable terms. Their raw datasets are not included. In particular,
an aggregate benchmark's software license does not replace third-party data
terms. Consult each task's PROVENANCE.md before acquiring or redistributing it.
